      "content": "I'll read the original test file and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture. The test has one active test method (`test_range`) but includes many unused data provider methods copied from a larger test class. The main issues are: unused methods adding noise, all data entries crammed on single lines, no grouping comments, and many unused imports.\n\nLet me write the improved test:Now I'll compile-check the file.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored file removes 7 unused data-provider methods and their associated imports, formats the `data_ranges()` entries one per line with aligned columns, and adds section comments that group the cases by year (leap 2012, non-leap 2013, non-leap 2011) and explain what each field range represents."
